    <region left="0" top="4266" width="605" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The building is 60 m long and is braced at both ends with infill walls between the framing beams and<br />columns. Determine the minimum thickness of the infill precast concrete walls at the first storey to<br />provide stability to the building. Use fcu = 35 N/mm2 for the walls and frame. Design wind pressure=<br />0.75 kN/m2 .</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="324" top="4329" width="93" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
