    <region left="0" top="6921" width="570" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Design the 250 mm thick wall AC in a single storey, unbraced building for the floor loading and<br />lateral wind load shown in the figure below. The design concrete strength is feu = 35 N/mm2 .</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="6957" width="483" height="232" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
